VALUES ((SELECT id FROM organizations WHERE slug = 'occasionsbox'), 'box-the-dinner-party', 'the-dinner-party', 'box', 'The Dinner Party', 'Everything the table needs except the guests. Three gold-plated cheese knives, leather coasters, a linen sun tea towel and a host book, finished with almond cookies for the board.', 175.00, 'each', NULL, '/assets/img/0B0_5612-750w.jpg', '["W&P | Host Book | Host is a modern guide to eating, drinking and entertaining. From intimate weeknight dinners to festive large-scale gatherings, Eric and Josh show how to be a better host with inspired-yet-approachable recipes and advice for creating delicious meals and unforgettable experiences .","Erin Flett | Sun Tea Towel | luxuriously absorbent woven flour sack cotton | can also be used for drying dishes | 26\" x 28\"","Viski Belmont Gold Plated Knife Set | A sophisticated set of three mirror-plated gold cheese knives. Set features a small cleaver for hard cheeses, a perforated blade for soft cheese and a fork-tipped spear knife for breaking apart crumbly cheese.---Stainless steel--Gold mirror finish--Set of 3","Lifetime Leather Co | Leather Coasters (set of 4)","Jocelyn & Co. | The Luxe Collection Almond Cookies | Almond cookies are soft, sour, and lightly drizzled with a cream cheese frosting. (6 oz)","Occasions Box Keepsake box | measures 11” x 8.66” x 4.33”","A Complimentary Handwritten card of your choice"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['hostess', 'client']::text[], 'Contains almond cookies (tree nuts).', 60, true)
